<div><a name="tileset.geometricerror" id="tileset.geometricerror"></a><h3>7.1.3<span class="fmt-clause-delim">.</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Tileset.geometricError</h3>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_b47b395c-b9a2-47ca-c5e4-2663d41735c2" id="_b47b395c-b9a2-47ca-c5e4-2663d41735c2"></a>The error, in meters, introduced if this tileset is not rendered. At runtime, the geometric error is used to compute screen space error (SSE), i.e., the error measured in pixels.</p>

<div class="ul_wrap"><p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo11;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst"><a name="_d2522ecd-5123-bac2-fae9-8b48043752c5" id="_d2522ecd-5123-bac2-fae9-8b48043752c5"></a><b>Type</b>: <tt>number</tt>
