</p>
<p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo11;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast"><a name="_b98777d8-157f-62b4-aaa6-f04876793137" id="_b98777d8-157f-62b4-aaa6-f04876793137"></a><b>Minimum</b>: <tt>&gt;= 0</tt>
</p>
</div>
</div>

