<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_a7279b44-03c3-3e42-1c5b-4d09e46e752b" id="_a7279b44-03c3-3e42-1c5b-4d09e46e752b"></a>Dictionary object with extension-specific objects.</p>

<div class="ul_wrap"><p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo56;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst"><a name="_1833e166-37f5-9e0b-c478-5a9dbbc41153" id="_1833e166-37f5-9e0b-c478-5a9dbbc41153"></a><b>Type</b>: <tt>object</tt>
</p>
