</p>
<p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo56;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast"><a name="_b131f923-557d-9395-8df8-eda648f03f96" id="_b131f923-557d-9395-8df8-eda648f03f96"></a><b>Type of each property</b>: Extension
