</div><div><a name="batched3dmodelfeaturetable_extras" id="batched3dmodelfeaturetable_extras"></a><h6>10.1.8.1.1.2<span class="fmt-clause-delim">.</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Batched3DModelFeatureTable.extras</h6>

