</p>
</div>
</div><div><a name="batched3dmodelfeaturetable_batch_length" id="batched3dmodelfeaturetable_batch_length"></a><h6>10.1.8.1.1.3<span class="fmt-clause-delim">.</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Batched3DModelFeatureTable.BATCH_LENGTH</h6>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_6e02c979-2758-6360-61bd-5e677c9b0103" id="_6e02c979-2758-6360-61bd-5e677c9b0103"></a>A <a href="#globalpropertycartesian3">GlobalPropertyCartesian3</a> object defining a numeric property for all features. See the corresponding property semantic in <a href="#_Semantics_2">Semantics</a>.</p>

<div class="ul_wrap"><p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo58;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst"><a name="_c6607421-674d-fbe8-a8f6-c4b6c30485a1" id="_c6607421-674d-fbe8-a8f6-c4b6c30485a1"></a><b>Type</b>: <tt>object, number[1], number</tt>
</p>
