</p>
</div>
</div><div><a name="batched3dmodelfeaturetable_rtc_center" id="batched3dmodelfeaturetable_rtc_center"></a><h6>10.1.8.1.1.4<span class="fmt-clause-delim">.</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Batched3DModelFeatureTable.RTC_CENTER</h6>

