</div>

<div><a name="sign" id="sign"></a><h4>11.3.9.12<span class="fmt-clause-delim">.</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>sign</h4>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_2d14898c-9dd2-14fc-854c-0eb4152c4a06" id="_2d14898c-9dd2-14fc-854c-0eb4152c4a06"></a><tt>sign(x : Number) : Number</tt><br/> <tt>sign(x : vec2) : vec2</tt><br/> <tt>sign(x : vec3) : vec3</tt><br/> <tt>sign(x : vec4) : vec4</tt></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_3622ab81-1c47-544c-760d-73031a0cec1b" id="_3622ab81-1c47-544c-760d-73031a0cec1b"></a>Returns <tt>1.0</tt> when <tt>x</tt> is positive, <tt>0.0</tt> when <tt>x</tt> is zero, and <tt>-1.0</tt> when <tt>x</tt> is negative.</p>

<p class="Sourcecode"><a name="_91f860e0-3e6f-5144-11f0-0e28cab74053" id="_91f860e0-3e6f-5144-11f0-0e28cab74053"></a><span class="p">{</span><br/>&#xA0; <span class="s2">"show"</span> <span class="p">:</span> <span class="s2">"sign(${Temperature}) * sign(${Velocity}) === 1.0"</span><br/><span class="p">}</span></p>

</div>

<div><a name="floor" id="floor"></a><h4>11.3.9.13<span class="fmt-clause-delim">.</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>floor</h4>

