<p class="Sourcecode"><a name="_a6930a56-afa7-a7c6-7621-820b1d845f05" id="_a6930a56-afa7-a7c6-7621-820b1d845f05"></a><span class="p">{</span><br/>&#xA0; <span class="s2">"show"</span> <span class="p">:</span> <span class="s2">"ceil(${Position}) === 1"</span><br/><span class="p">}</span></p>

</div>

