<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_26a99216-0406-00da-88e1-9fd3255c8b96" id="_26a99216-0406-00da-88e1-9fd3255c8b96"></a>Returns <tt>2</tt> to the power of <tt>x</tt>.</p>

