<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_c2569b33-4477-f960-14b7-1006462e28c3" id="_c2569b33-4477-f960-14b7-1006462e28c3"></a>Returns the base <tt>2</tt> logarithm of <tt>x</tt>.</p>

